# Supabase — copy to .env.local and fill in from your project's
# Settings → API page. Both are safe to expose to the browser (anon key).
#
# Also required for magic-link auth (Supabase dashboard → Authentication):
#   • enable the Email provider
#   • URL Configuration → Site URL + add redirect URLs:
#       http://localhost:3000/auth/confirm  (and your production equivalent)
# And run the migrations in supabase/migrations/ in order (0001_auth_and_visibility.sql,
# then 0002_render_target.sql) in the SQL editor.
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-public-key
